<view class="page">
 <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">XUEGU TRAVEL / 雪谷旅行</text><view class="title">一程雪景，一份清晰报价</view><text class="subtitle">往返接送 · 温暖住宿 · 雪山体验</text></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="heading">01 / 行程信息</view>
 <view class="row"><text>客户姓名</text><input placeholder="请输入客户姓名" value="{{form.customer}}" data-field="customer" bindinput="field" maxlength="30"/></view>
 <view class="row"><text>出行日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date}}" data-field="date" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.date || '选择日期 ›'}}</view></picker></view>
 <view class="row"><text>出行人数</text><input type="number" value="{{form.people}}" data-field="people" bindinput="field"/></view>
 <view class="row"><text>住宿晚数</text><input type="number" value="{{form.nights}}" data-field="nights" bindinput="field"/></view>
 <view class="row"><text>房间数量</text><input type="number" value="{{form.rooms}}" data-field="rooms" bindinput="field"/></view>
 </view>
 <view class="card"><view class="heading">02 / 费用明细</view><text class="hint">车费按提供的票价表计算；雾凇岭默认400元/人；羊草山门票40元/人加选项目；住宿手动填写</text>
 <view class="fee" wx:for="{{form.items}}" wx:key="key"><view class="row"><text class="fee-name">{{item.name}}</text><switch color="#287d7a" checked="{{item.enabled}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="enabled" bindchange="item"/></view><block wx:if="{{index === 0 && item.enabled}}">
 <picker range="{{['选择直通车线路','手动填写车费']}}" value="{{form.transportType === 'routes' ? 0 : 1}}" bindchange="transport"><view class="pill">{{form.transportType === 'routes' ? '选择直通车线路' : '手动填写车费'}} ▾</view></picker>
 <block wx:if="{{form.transportType === 'routes'}}">
 <view class="route-label">去程</view><picker range="{{routeLabels}}" value="{{outboundIndex}}" data-field="outbound" bindchange="route"><view class="pill">{{routeLabels[outboundIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
 <view wx:if="{{outboundRoute}}" class="hint">发车：{{outboundRoute.departure}} · 车程{{outboundRoute.duration}}</view>
 <view wx:if="{{form.outbound === '0'}}"><view class="row"><text>哈尔滨发车时间</text><picker range="{{outboundTimes}}" value="{{outboundTimeIndex}}" bindchange="outboundTime"><view class="pill">{{form.outboundTime || '待定'}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="hint">车程约5小时：6:00出发约11:00到雪谷，可接当天12:30–13:00雾凇岭；8:00及午间班车需安排次日雾凇岭。</view></view><view wx:if="{{outboundRoute && form.outbound !== '0'}}" class="row"><text>去程发车时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.otherOutboundTime}}" data-field="otherOutboundTime" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.otherOutboundTime || '选择时间'}} ›</view></picker></view><view class="route-label">返程 / 第二段</view><picker range="{{routeLabels}}" value="{{inboundIndex}}" data-field="inbound" bindchange="route"><view class="pill">{{routeLabels[inboundIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
 <view wx:if="{{inboundRoute}}" class="hint">发车：{{inboundRoute.departure}} · 车程{{inboundRoute.duration}}</view>
 <block wx:if="{{inboundRoute}}"><view class="row"><text>返程日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.inboundDate}}" start="{{form.date}}" data-field="inboundDate" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.inboundDate || '待定'}} ›</view></picker></view><view class="row"><text>返程发车时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.inboundTime}}" data-field="inboundTime" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.inboundTime || '待定'}} ›</view></picker></view></block><view class="hint">所选车程合计 ¥{{routeFare}} / 人，乘以出行人数。单程请选择另一段为“不含此车程”。</view>
 <view class="hint">联乘可在雪乡下车游玩，行李可留在车上，18:00或20:00转车去雪谷。班次和票价以订车确认为准。</view>
 </block></block>
 <view wx:if="{{item.enabled && (index !== 0 || form.transportType !== 'routes') && (item.key !== 'wusong' || !form.wusongPackage) && (item.key !== 'yangcao' || !form.yangcaoOptions)}}" class="row"><picker range="{{item.units}}" value="{{item.mode}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="mode" bindchange="item"><view class="pill">{{item.units[item.mode]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="price"><text>¥</text><input type="digit" placeholder="填写单价" value="{{item.price}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="price" bindinput="item"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{item.key === 'wusong' && item.enabled}}"><block wx:if="{{form.wusongPackage}}"><view class="hint">全票400元/位，套票包含下列全部项目。儿童人数包含在出行总人数中；其余人数按全票计算。</view><view class="row"><text>半票人数（1米至不足1.2米）</text><input type="number" value="{{form.wusongHalf}}" data-field="wusongHalf" bindinput="field" style="width:100rpx"/></view><view class="row"><text>免票人数（不足1米）</text><input type="number" value="{{form.wusongFree}}" data-field="wusongFree" bindinput="field" style="width:100rpx"/></view></block><view wx:else class="hint">这是旧版历史报价，保留原价。新建报价可使用最新套票及儿童规则。</view><view class="row"><text>雾凇岭游玩日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.wusongDate || form.date}}" start="{{form.date}}" data-field="wusongDate" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.wusongDate || '出行当天（可改日期）'}} ›</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{scheduleMessage}}" class="schedule-warning">{{scheduleMessage}}</view><view class="row"><text>上山时间</text><picker range="{{wusongTimes}}" value="{{wusongTimeIndex}}" bindchange="wusongTime"><view class="pill">{{form.wusongTime || '待定'}} ▾</view></picker></view><text class="hint">上山班次：7:00、9:00、12:30–13:00。返程一直有陆续返回的车辆。</text><view class="hint">现金支付；没有现金可找客栈老板换。</view><view class="hint">包含：往返接送到山脚（车程30分钟）、山脚至山顶往返雪地摩托、雪地摩托丛林穿越、赏雾凇、山顶看日落、山顶雪地摩托自驾、滑雪、雪爬犁、雪地长龙、雪地龙舟、雪飘。</view><text class="hint">每天小满老爸免费带玩，360全景相机免费拍视频记录</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.key === 'yangcao' && item.enabled && form.yangcaoOptions}}"><view class="row"><text>羊草山游玩日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.yangcaoDate}}" start="{{form.date}}" data-field="yangcaoDate" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.yangcaoDate || '待定'}} ›</view></picker></view><view class="row"><text>羊草山出发时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.yangcaoTime}}" data-field="yangcaoTime" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.yangcaoTime || '待定'}} ›</view></picker></view><picker range="{{yangcaoPlanLabels}}" value="{{form.yangcaoPlan}}" bindchange="yangcaoPlan"><view class="pill">{{yangcaoPlanLabels[form.yangcaoPlan]}} ▾</view></picker><view wx:if="{{form.yangcaoPlan == 1}}" class="hint">套票550元/人，包含马拉爬犁往返、天下第一漂、雪地摩托车。不去雪乡，不需要雪乡回雪谷车票；包含的项目不重复收费。儿童优惠待确认，目前按550元/人计算。</view><block wx:if="{{form.yangcaoPlan == 0}}"><view class="hint">穿越门票40元/人，雪谷→雪乡穿越必经门票。身高不足1.2米免门票，恰好1.2米按全票。其他加选项目按全体出行人数计费。</view><view class="row"><text>免门票人数（不足1.2米）</text><input type="number" value="{{form.yangcaoFree}}" data-field="yangcaoFree" bindinput="field" style="width:100rpx"/></view><view class="hint">路线：雪谷 → 茶房 → 羊草山山顶 → 雪乡。全程约15公里，上山约10公里，下山约5公里；雪谷出发9:00–11:00。</view><view class="row"><text>马拉爬犁 · 100元/人</text><switch color="#287d7a" checked="{{form.yangcaoHorse}}" data-field="yangcaoHorse" bindchange="field"/></view><view class="hint">5公里进山，氛围感强，省力进山。</view><picker range="{{yangcaoSnowLabels}}" value="{{form.yangcaoSnow}}" data-field="yangcaoSnow" bindchange="field"><view class="pill">{{yangcaoSnowLabels[form.yangcaoSnow]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="hint">茶房至山顶约5公里：全程摩托300元覆盖这5公里；半程150元仅覆盖后2.5公里，前半段不提供半程摩托，需徒步。半程与全程只能选择一个；马拉爬犁覆盖雪谷至茶房约5公里，单独加选。</view><view class="route-label">雪飘方向（二选一）</view><picker range="{{yangcaoSlideLabels}}" value="{{form.yangcaoSlideMode}}" data-field="yangcaoSlideMode" bindchange="field"><view class="pill">{{yangcaoSlideLabels[form.yangcaoSlideMode]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="hint">雪飘滑行约3公里，下山路段共约5公里。80元雪飘去雪乡；天下第一漂150元往雪谷方向，从山顶返回茶房，不是直达雪谷。</view><view class="hint">公路返程：雪乡→雪谷，大巴/拼车60元/人。如需计入，请在车费中选择“雪乡五常山门→雪谷小满客栈”，此处不另收费。</view></block></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{!(form.items[3].enabled && form.yangcaoOptions && form.yangcaoPlan == 1)}}" class="fee"><view class="row"><text>晚上雪乡回雪谷 · 60元/人</text><switch color="#287d7a" checked="{{form.nightReturn}}" data-field="nightReturn" bindchange="field"/></view><view class="hint">18:00、20:00，约2小时。已选相同直通车线路时不会重复收费。此票适用于去雪乡后返回雪谷的行程。</view><block wx:if="{{form.nightReturn}}"><view class="row"><text>夜间返程日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.nightReturnDate || form.yangcaoDate}}" data-field="nightReturnDate" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.nightReturnDate || form.yangcaoDate || '待定'}} ›</view></picker></view><view class="row"><text>夜间返程时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.nightReturnTime}}" data-field="nightReturnTime" bindchange="field"><view>{{form.nightReturnTime || '待定'}} ›</view></picker></view></block></view><view class="row"><text>备注</text><input placeholder="如餐费、集合地点" value="{{form.note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="field" maxlength="100"/></view>
 </view>
 <button class="primary" bindtap="quote">生成行程及报价</button>
 <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="summary"><view class="heading">你的时间行程</view><view wx:for="{{result.itinerary}}" wx:key="index" class="timeline-entry"><view class="timeline-time">{{item.dateLabel}} · {{item.time}}</view><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.detail}}</view></view><view class="heading">费用明细</view><view wx:for="{{result.lines}}" wx:key="name" wx:if="{{item.enabled}}" class="row"><view><text>{{item.name}} × {{item.qty}}</text><view wx:if="{{item.detail}}" class="hint">{{item.detail}}</view></view><text>¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{form.items[2].enabled}}" class="hint">雾凇岭：{{form.wusongDate || form.date || '出行当天'}} {{form.wusongTime || '待定'}} · 现金支付</view><view class="total">¥{{result.total}}</view><text>人均约 ¥{{result.perPerson}} · {{form.people}} 人</text><view class="actions"><button bindtap="save">保存报价</button><button bindtap="poster">生成行程图片</button></view><button bindtap="copyItinerary">复制文字行程发给客户</button><text class="hint">图片预览后可长按保存或转发。报价仅含列明项目。</text></view>
 <view class="actions"><button bindtap="reset">新建报价</button><button open-type="share">分享小程序</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="card"><view class="heading">最近报价 · 本机保存</view><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="restore"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>¥{{item.total}} ›</text></view></view>
 <view class="footer">雪谷 · 雾凇岭 · 羊草山</view>
 <canvas canvas-id="quoteCanvas" style="position:fixed;left:-2000px;width:600px;height:{{posterHeight}}px"/>
</view>
